<title>USA: SFX says Q4 revs top $50 million.</title>
<headline>SFX says Q4 revs top $50 million.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>SFX Broadcasting Inc said its revenues for the fourth quarter ended December 31 topped $50 million, while revenues for the year rose to about $143 million.</p>
<p>The company did not make estimates for its earnings during the quarter or the year.</p>
<p>Officials there were not immediately available.</p>
<p>The company also said its broadcast cash flow rose to more than $18 million for the quarter and to about $50 million for the year.</p>
<p>SFX will report its fourth-quarter and fiscal 1996 earnings on February 20, it said.</p>
</text>
